# Witness dgfault rules. First match wins, so put specific rules above general ones.
#
# Every rule must be explainable to a frightened non-technical person in the
# triage text below it. If you can't write that text, the rule doesn't ship.
#
# Event IDs for the Security-Mitigations channels follow Microsoft's
# "Exploit protection reference" (odd = audit, even = block):
#   1/2 ACG   3/4 child process   5/6 low-integrity image   7/8 remote image
#   9/10 win32k   11/12 CIG   13/14 EAF   15/16 EAF+   17/18 IAF
#   19/20 ROP StackPivot machine before changinder positional form.
# 0xC0000409 = STATUS_STACK_BUFFER_OVERRUN. Raised by /GS cookie failures,
# CET shadow-stack violations and __fastfail(). All three mean "memory
# safety violation caught before it did damage". Honest text says so.

